%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Ọna asopọ atunyẹwo yii ko wulo mọ. Bi o tilẹ jẹ pe o le beere fun tuntun kan.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Àwọn àlàyé púpọ̀ jù lọ wá láti ọ̀nà àjápọ̀ yìí ní wákàtí tó kọjá. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nígbà míì.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Ipa rẹ ko le ṣẹda awọn awoṣe tabi awọn apẹẹrẹ.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'O le yipada ọrọ ati awọn aworan lori oju-iwe yii, ṣugbọn kii ṣe apẹrẹ tabi iṣeto rẹ. A ko fipamọ iyipada rẹ.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Ko le yipada awọn àṣà ipa rẹ. Fa awọn ayipada àṣà naa sẹhin ki o tun fipamọ lẹẹkansi.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Ipò rẹ ko le fi kún tabi yipada koodu aṣa (CSS aṣa tabi awọn apoti HTML). Mu awọn ayipada wọnyẹn kuro ki o tun fi pamọ lẹẹkansi.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Èyí kì í ṣe fáìlì ìwọlé láti inú plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Wọ́n fi ẹ̀yà tuntun tiplọ́gì̀n yìí ṣe fáìlì ìkejáde yìí. Ṣe imudojuiwọn plọ́gì̀n náà lórí ojula yii, lẹhinna tun gbe e wọle lẹẹkansi.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Fáìlì wíwọlé náà bàjẹ́: àkọsílẹ̀ àwọn ohun èlò rẹ̀ ti sọnù.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Fáìlì wíwọlé náà ti bà jẹ́ tàbí a ti yí i padà lẹ́yìn tí a dá a (àmì ìfẹsẹ̀ẹ́ rẹ̀ kò bá mu). Tun wọlé rẹ̀ jade láti ojula miiran.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'A kò kó “%s” wọlé: ojula yii ko ni iru ohun kan na.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'A ko gbe “%s” wọle: a o gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda iru ohun kan bẹẹ.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'A kò rọ́pò “%s”: a ò gba ọ láyè láti ṣàtúnṣe èyí tí ó wà lórí ojú-wẹ́bù yìí.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s” ko wọlé: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'A ko wọ àwọn ètò ná الأصل: olùṣàkóso nìkan ló lè yí wọn pa dà.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'A ko da aworan %1$s kọọ: %2$s','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Tun fi awọn imọran ti o farasin han lori Ìpamọ́ lẹẹkansi','All'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀','%d selected'=>'%d ti yan','Nothing matches.'=>'Ko si ohun ti o baamu.','Select all on this page'=>'Yan ohun gbogbo lori oju-iwe yii','Select'=>'Yan','Pages'=>'Àwọn Ojúewé','Previous'=>'Tẹ́lẹ̀','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ojú-ìwé %1$d ti %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Ṣètì %s ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀','Start setup'=>'Bẹrẹ iṣeto','This site'=>'Ojula yii','Edition'=>'Àtúnṣe','Sites on this licence'=>'Awọn oju opo wẹẹbu lori iwe-ašẹ yii','Version'=>'Ẹya','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Eyi dabi ẹni pe o jẹ ajọṣepọ tabi ẹ̀ka agbegbe, nitorina ko ni lo aaye kan lori iwe-ašẹ rẹ.','See what Pro adds'=>'Wo ohun ti Pro fi kun un','Go to'=>'Lọ sí','Personal'=>'Ti ara ẹni','Business'=>'Onísòwò','Agency'=>'Ilé-iṣẹ́ ajọ','Any number of sites'=>'Gbogbo iye awọn oju opo wẹẹbu','Unlimited sites'=>'Àwọn ojula aláìlópin','%d site'=>'%d ojula','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Ayẹwo %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Ìdánwò rẹ ti bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà láti rí gbogbo ẹ̀yà ara Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'A kò lè bẹ̀rẹ̀ àdánwò náà.','Feature'=>'Ẹ̀yà ara','Included'=>'Ti a fi kun','Not included'=>'Ko si ninu','Your licence'=>'Ìwé-àṣẹ rẹ','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ti n lo','Renews'=>'Túnṣe rẹ̀','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà ìpìlẹ̀ (staging), ìdánwò, ati localhost ti ojú-opó kan jẹ́ ọ̀fẹ́, wọn kì í sì í ka sí i nínú àlà ojú-opó rẹ.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Ètò rẹ pẹ̀lú ìtìlẹ́yìn àkọ́kọ́.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Ṣàkóso ìwé-àṣẹ àti owó rẹ','Get more with Pro'=>'Gbà jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ pẹ̀lú Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bẹrẹ idanwo ọfẹ ọjọ %d, ko si kaadi ti o nilo','See plans and prices'=>'Wo awọn eto ati awọn owo rẹ','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Lo Tranzly ati Page Builder Sandwich papọ? Apapọ naa ni awọn afikun Pro mejeeji ninu fun idiyele kekere.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Ìwé àṣẹ rẹ ti parí. Sọ ọ́ di tuntun láti máa gba àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun àti àwọn ẹ̀yà Pro lọ́wọ́.','Renew now'=>'Se atunṣe ni isisiyi','Compare the plans'=>'Ṣe afiwe awọn ètò náà','Search features'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ ìwárí','Area'=>'Agbègbè','Included in'=>'Wọn nínú','No feature matches.'=>'Kò sí ànímọ́ tí ó bá mu.','Features by plan'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ nípa ètò iṣẹ́','Hide'=>'Pa mọ́','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Mú u ṣiṣẹ lori iboju Awọn afikun (Plugins)','Install it'=>'Fi sori ẹ','Overview'=>'Àkópọ̀','Setup'=>'Ìṣètò','Plans and licence'=>'Àwọn ètò àti ìwé àṣẹ','Add-ons'=>'Àfikún','Get help'=>'Gbà ìrànlọ́wọ́','Feedback'=>'Èsì','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Àכוֹyọ̀ rẹ kò lè se é gbà sí sílẹ̀.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fipamọ́ ipò ìṣètò náà.','Match my computer'=>'Bá kọmpútà mi mu','Light'=>'Imọlẹ','Dark'=>'Òkùnkùn','Colour scheme'=>'Àwòrán àwọ̀','Help'=>'Iranlowo','Guide to this screen'=>'Itọsọna si oju-iwo yii','Take the tour'=>'Gbà ìṣẹ̀wò náà','Get help or report a bug'=>'Gbà ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí jábọ̀ àṣìṣe kan','Plugin screens'=>'Awọn oju-iwe afikun','That could not be saved.'=>'Ko ṣe e fipamọ́ náà.','Before you contact support'=>'Ṣáájú kí o tó kàn sí ìrànlọ́wọ́','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Awon ibeere re ni a fi ranse lati ojula yi si %s, awon ti o se afikun yi. A n ranse:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adirẹsi e-mail àti orúkọ rẹ, kí a lè dáhùn;','the subject and message you write;'=>'àkọlé àti ìránṣẹ́ tí o kọ;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID ìṣẹ́-oṣù rẹ, nítorí náà àwọn oníbàárà tí wọ́n ń sanwó ń gba àǹfààní àkọ́kọ́;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kiki ti o ba fi aami si i: awọn alaye aaye (awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP, akori, awọn afikun, apakan kan ti log aṣiṣe pẹlu awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle ati awọn adirẹsi e-mail ti yọ kuro), eyiti o le ka ṣaaju fifiranṣẹ;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'nikan ti o ba fi kun wọn: awọn ìwọlé fun aaye rẹ, ti a fipamọ sori aabo ati ti a paẹ rẹ 30 ọjọ lẹhin ti ibeere rẹ ti ni pipade.','Privacy policy'=>'Eto asiri','I agree, continue'=>'Mo gba, tẹsiwaju','The connection could not be checked.'=>'A kò lè yẹ àsopọ̀ náà wò.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Ìyẹn ò ṣiṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital® ti ge isopọ aaye yii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital® kò mọ ojula yii mọ.','You disconnected this site.'=>'O ti yọ aaye yii kuro.','Connect this site to support'=>'So pọ si ojula yii si atilẹyin','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'A ti sopọ. Awọn idahun lọ si %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ko sopọ. O tun le firanṣẹ ibeere kan pẹlu adirẹsi imeeli rẹ ni isalẹ; sisopọ gba ọ laaye lati má ṣe tun tẹ e ni akoko kọọkan.','E-mail address'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli','Your name (optional)'=>'Oruko re (ti o ba fe)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Mo gba lati sopọ aaye yii pẹlu atilẹyin Zinn Digital®. O n ran adirẹsi aaye yii, awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP ati ẹya pugin naa, o si le ge asopọ nigbakugba lati ibi tabi nipasẹ Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'So pọ̀','I need help'=>'Mo nilo iranlọwọ','Report a bug'=>'Ṣe ijabọ aṣiṣe kan','Send feedback'=>'Fi ero sílẹ̀','Request a feature'=>'Bere lọ́wọ́ fún ẹ̀yà kan','The site details could not be read.'=>'A kò lè ka àwọn àlàyé ojú òpó wọ̀nyí.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'A kò lè fi ìbéèrè rẹ ránṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ sẹ́yìn.','WordPress admin'=>'Alámojútọ WordPress','File manager'=>'Olùṣàkóso fáìlì','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Èrò àti àwọn ìbéèrè fún àfikún ẹ̀yà','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'A ránṣẹ́. Ìtọ́kasí rẹ ni %s, ìdáhùn wa yóò sì dé nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','What is it about?'=>'Kini nipa rẹ?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Fidahun sí (imeeli)','Subject'=>'Àkọlé','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Kí lo ṣe, kí lo retí, kí sì ni ó wáyé dípò bẹ́ẹ̀?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Fi alaye aaye kun (awọn ẹya, akori, awọn afikun, apakan akọọlẹ aṣiṣe)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Wo gan-an ohun ti a ranṣẹ','Loading…'=>'Ó ń gbé wọlé…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Àwọn ìwọlé fún ìtìlẹ́yìn (kò pandan, a ti kó wọn pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ìpamọ́)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'A fi ìwọlé ránṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà rẹ̀ nìkan. Fi ara kan sílẹ̀ dípò kí o fi ìyẹn sílẹ̀ ní bọ́bọ́.','Login address'=>'Adirẹsi ìwọlé','Username'=>'Orúkọ olùṣe','Password'=>'Ọrọ̀ aṣínà','Add a login'=>'Fi wọlé kún rẹ','Create a temporary support login'=>'Ṣẹda iwọle àtìlẹyìnfún ìgbà díẹ̀','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Olumulo lọtọ fun ẹgbẹ atilẹyin wa, laisi iwọle si awọn olumulo, fifi sori awọn afikun tabi ṣiṣatunkọ koodu. A pa a rẹ ni adaṣe nigbati o ba pari, tabi nigbakugba ti o ba sọ ọ di asan ni isalẹ.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Bẹẹni, fún ọjọ́ %d','Send'=>'Fi ranṣẹ','The list could not be loaded.'=>'A le gbe àkọlé náa kalẹ̀.','That login could not be removed.'=>'A kò le yọ ìwọlé yẹn kúrò.','Temporary support logins'=>'Àwọnwọlé ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ìgbà díẹ̀','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Ko si. Atileyin le wole si aaye yii nikan ti o ba seda iwole kan nibi.','expired, being removed'=>'ti pari akoko re, a n yọ kuro','expires %s'=>'kọja akoko ni %s','Revoke now'=>'Fagile báyìí','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Igbese %1$d ti %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Pa ìrin-àjò náà mọ́lẹ̀','Back'=>'Padà','Everything in one place'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀ ní ibi kan','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Awọn taabu wọnyi yori si gbogbo iboju ti pọọgi-in naa: iṣeto, awọn eto, iwe-ašẹ rẹ, iranlọwọ ati diẹ sii.','Help on every screen'=>'Iranlọwọ lori gbogbo iboju','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Ṣí àkójọ yìí fún ìtọ́sọ́nà sí ojú-ìwé tí o wà, ìtọjú yìí, tàbí láti béèrè ìrànlọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́ wa.','Light or dark'=>'Imọlẹ tabi òkùnkùn','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yan ìmọ́lẹ̀, òkùnkùn, tàbí kí o jẹ́ kí ó bá ti kọmpútà rẹ mu. A óò rántí àṣàyàn rẹ fún ìwọ nìkan.','Welcome'=>'Ẹ káàbọ̀','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Irin-ajo kukuru yii fihan ibi ti awọn nkan wa. O le jade kuro ninu rẹ nigbakugba pẹlu bọtini Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Ojula oju opo wẹẹti rẹ','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ilọsiwaju iṣeto ati eto rẹ ni a fihan nibi, pẹlu ohun ti o tẹle ti o tọ lati ṣe.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Ètò rẹ, iye àwọn ojú-wọ́gbẹ̀ ti ó bo, àti pé bóya ẹ̀dà ojú-wọ́gbẹ̀ yìí ka sí iye tó ní lọ́kàn.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gbiyanju Pro tabiṣe igbega si ipele giga','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bẹrẹ ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ láìní káàdì, mú kí ó sunwọ̀n sí i, tàbí sọ di tuntun, gbogbo rẹ̀ láti ibi yìí.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Gbogbo ẹ̀ya àti ètò tí ó ní i nínú. Wá ẹ̀ya kan tàbí fi agbègbè kan hàn ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Àfikún láti ọwọ́ Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Awọn ohun itanna ti o ṣiṣẹ pẹlu eyi, ati awọn iṣẹ lati ẹgbẹ kanna. Awọn kaadi ti o farasin ni awọn iboju miiran ni a le tun fi han nibi.','Connect for faster help'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ra fún ìrànlọ́wọ́ tó yára jù','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Asopọ jẹ aṣayan. O jẹ ki o firanṣẹ awọn ibeere laisi titẹ imeeli rẹ ni akoko kọọkan, ati pe o le ge asopọ nigbakugba ti o ba fẹ.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí jábọ̀ àṣìṣe kan','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Ṣapejuwe ohun ti o ṣẹlẹ. O yan boya lati so alaye aaye pọ, ati pe o le rii daju deede ohun ti o ni ninu ni akọkọ.','Temporary support access'=>'Ìwọ̀lé ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ìgbà díẹ̀','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Tí àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ bá nílò láti wọ inú ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sùn rẹ, dá ìwọ̀lé-sílẹ̀ fúngbà-díẹ̀ sílẹ̀ níbí. Ó ń pa ara rẹ̀ rẹ́ nígbà tí àkókò bá parí, o sì lè yọ ọ́ kúrò nígbàkigbà.','Tell us what to build'=>'Sọ fún wa ohun tí a ó kọ́','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Fi èrò, ìbéèrè fún ẹ̀yà kan tàbí ìdáhùn èyíkéyìí ránṣẹ́. Ó lọ taara sí ẹgbẹ́ náà.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Eyi gba iṣẹju diẹ yoo si ṣeto %s ki o le ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii lẹsẹkẹsẹ. O le yipada ohun gbogbo nigbamii.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'O ti ṣetan. Bí ohunkohun kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ṣe retí rẹ̀, a wa lójú kanṣoṣo.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %1$d nínú %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Paríwò','Skip setup'=>'Fò ètò lọ','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tirẹ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga ti Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Ẹya %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Wọ́ọ̀bùsìtì Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Ojula oju opo wẹbusiti Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ẹ̀yà ara pamọ́.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo awọn ètò Pro ati awọn owo rẹ','Front-end output'=>'Abajade iwaju-ipari','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàsì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ jáde sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, kí àwọn ojú ewé náà má bàa fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. Lédè tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Save'=>'Fi pamọ́','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn ohun ìgbàlejò tí wọ́n ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ń dánwò','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula itanna yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹ bi imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduro nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyi pada sori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon ẹya beta ni a n fún awọn fifi sori ẹrọ Pro ti o ni iwe-ašẹ ti o si ni asopọ si akọọlẹ wọn. Ni kete ti o ba ni asopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Akọọlẹ.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Àwọn ibi ìfojúsùn ti fipamọ́. Àwọn ojúewé náà yóò mú àwọn ìbú tuntun náà nígbà tí wọ́n bá tún ṣí i.','Breakpoints'=>'Àwọn ìlà ìdúró','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Àwọn àṣà tí a ṣètò fún Tábìlì wúlò dé ìwọ̀n ìbú tábìlì, àti àwọn àṣà fún Móbìlì dé ìwọ̀n ìbú móbìlì. Àwọn àṣà Desktop wúlò ní gbogbo ibòmíràn.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Tábìlì: tó pọ̀ jù (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Alagbeka: o pọ ju (px) lọ','Save breakpoints'=>'Fipamọ awọn aaye iduro','Use the default widths'=>'Lo awọn iwọn aiyipada','Settings'=>'Ètò','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ìbéèrè fún yíyí àpilẹ̀kọ yìí padà dáwọ́ dúró kí ó tó parí, nítorí náà a fò á kọjá. Ṣí i láti yí i padà, tàbí kí o tún yí i padà láti ibi yìí.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ko si afẹyinti ifiweranṣẹ yii lati mu pada sipo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fi àwọn ohun tí a yí padà sí pamọ́.','Unknown error.'=>'Àṣìṣe àìmọ̀.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Àכו́nù ìصàìnìì tí a ti ṣe àyèwò fún kò tìì wà.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Mu ohun ti a jogun pada: %1$d ninu %2$d awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Yí akópawé atijọ padà: %1$d nínú %2$d àwọn àfikún.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá padà parí: %1$d ti padà bọ̀ sípò, %2$d kùnà.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ìyípadà parí: %1$d ti yí padà, %2$d kò yí padà, %3$d kùnà.','Legacy content'=>'Akoonu atijọ','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Awọn ojú-ewé tí a fi àwọn ẹ̀yà Page Builder Sandwich tẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ̀ ṣe ni a ń yí padà sí àwọn blọọku lẹ́yìn. A ṣe àfikún afẹ́yinti fún gbogbo post ní àkọ́kọ́, nitorinaa a le da ìyípadà kọ̀ọ̀kan padà.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Fífọ́kànsì %d ṣì ní àkóովé àtijọ́ nínú.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d post ni afẹyinti kan.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti ṣe àkóso àpilẹ̀kọ %d kan','Post %d'=>'Ifihan %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìyípadà bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò lórí ojú-ewé yìí.','Convert legacy content'=>'Yi akoonu atijọ pada','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe gbogbo àpilẹ̀kọ tí a ti yí padà sí ohun àlùmọ́ni wọn tẹ́lẹ̀? Àwọn àtúnṣe tí a ṣe sí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ yẹn láti ìgbà tí a ti yí wọn padà yóò sọnù.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ìṣẹ̀dá sẹ́yìn bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ó ń tẹ̀ síwájú ní ẹ̀yìn; o le kúrò ní ojú ewé yìí.','Undo all conversions'=>'Pa gbogbo iyipada rẹ kuro','Alert'=>'Ìkìlọ̀','Information'=>'Alaye','Success'=>'Àṣeyọrí','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Awon ikilo ati asise ni a n fi to awon olumulo to n lo ero kika iboju leti lojukanna; a n ka awon akọsilẹ alaye ati ti asori nipa igba ti wọn ba pari ohun ti wọn n se.','Show icon'=>'Fi àwòrán hàn','Visitors can close it'=>'Àwọn àlejò lè pa á','Title (optional)'=>'Àkọlé (aṣàyàn)','Write the message…'=>'Kọ ifiranṣẹ na…','section — a thematic section'=>'apakan — apakan akori kan','div — no meaning'=>'div — kò sí ìtumọ̀','header — introductory content'=>'àlàyé — àkóbá ìbẹ̀rẹ̀','footer — closing content'=>'àlàyé ìpínlẹ̀ – àfikún ìparọ̀','article — self-contained content'=>'nkan tí ó wà nínú ara rẹ̀ — àkóónú tí ó dúró fún ra rẹ̀','aside — related content'=>'apakan — akoonu ti o jọmọ','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'akọkọ — akọkọ akoonu (lẹẹkan fun oju-iwe kan)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — àwọn ìjápọ̀ ìwakọ̀','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Stack (flexbox, kọlọmọ)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Ahọn (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Giriidu','Layout'=>'Àgbékalẹ̀','Editing: %s'=>'Gbígbà sí àtúnṣe: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Tẹ awọn ọmọ bii','Inherited (%s)'=>'Wọn ti jogun (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Awọn bulọọki ti a kojọpọ','Columns'=>'Àwọn kọlọmù','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Fa si inu kanfasi naa, tabi tẹ́','Content width'=>'Ìgbòòrò àkóónú','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Fífín (ìbú ohun tí ó wà nínú akori náà)','Full width'=>'Gbogbo iwọn','Minimum height'=>'Giga tó kéré jù','HTML tag'=>'Aami HTML','Link'=>'So pọ̀ọ̀kùn','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Ṣe gbòǹgbò àkójọpọ̀ yìí ní ìjápọ̀ sí','Link text for screen readers'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ ìjápọ̀ fún àwọn olùkà ibrènsi','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Ohun ti ọna asọfun n se, fun awọn alejò ti ko le ri bulọọki na.','Open in a new tab'=>'Ṣíṣí ní taabu tuntun kan','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Má ṣe fi àwọn àpèjọ (links) tàbí àwọn bọ́tìnnì sí inú àpèjọ tí a ti sopọ̀ mọ́: àpèjọ kan tó wà nínú àpèjọ míì kì í ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àwọn wẹ́bù àṣàwádìí (browsers).','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Fa lati tun iwọn awọn iwe yii ṣe','Drag to resize this row'=>'Fa lati tun iwọn ila yii ṣe','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Fa sẹ̀lẹ̀ kọjá láti ṣètò iye àwọn kọlọmù àti rọ́wọ́ tí bálókù yìí gba','+ Column'=>'+ Ọwọ́-ìtò sí','− Column'=>'− Òpó','+ Row'=>'+ Ìlà','− Row'=>'− Àtẹ','Switch'=>'Yipada','Label'=>'Àmì','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Àwọn olùkàwé ojú-ìwé ló ń kọ́ ọ jáde, a sì ń fi hàn nígbà tí “Fi àmì hàn” bá wà ní títàn.','Show label'=>'Ṣe afihan àmì','Shortcode tag'=>'Àmì kékeré fún ìlà kíkúrú','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Lo lẹta, nọmba, àmì iyọkuro ati àmì abẹlẹ nikan.','Attribute name'=>'Orúkọ ànímọ́','Add attribute'=>'Fi àfikún kún un','Shortcode'=>'Koodu Kúrúsì','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Yan ami aami kukuru kan ninu awọn eto bulọọki naa.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ìṣàkóso "%s" láti inú olootu àtijọ́ kò sí ní olootu bọ́lọ́kì náà. Tẹ iye náà sínú gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀.','Choose image'=>'Yan àwòrán','Choose file'=>'Yan fáìlì','— Default —'=>'— Aiyipada —','Advanced styling'=>'Ìlànà aṣọ tó ga julọ','Inline CSS'=>'CSS Abẹnu','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Àwọn ìkéde CSS, fún àpẹrẹ: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Àwọn ipa (àwọn kíláìsì ìṣẹ̀dá àtijọ́)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Àwọn orúkọ ipa tí a pín nípa lílo àlàfo tí ó wá láti àwọn ẹ̀dà àtijọ́, fún àpẹẹrẹ: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Ahọnni','Width'=>'Ìbú','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Fífẹ̀ kíkún, a pa àwọn àkóónú mọ́ láàárín','Link address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì ìjápọ̀','Link relationship'=>'Asiko idapo awon oju-opona','Alignment'=>'Àgbékalẹ̀','Left'=>'Apa osi','Centre'=>'Àárín','Right'=>'Ọtún','Button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtini','Add text…'=>'Fi ọrọ kun…','Accessible label'=>'Àmìwò ẹ̀rọ alábòójútó tí ó ṣeé wọlé','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí nǹkankan fún àmì ìṣọ́ṣọ́.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Yan àmì kan ninu awọn eto bulọọki.','New setting name'=>'Orúkọ ètò tuntun','For example: title or text'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: àkọlé tàbí ọrọ̀','Add setting'=>'Fi ètò kun','Widget'=>'Wíjẹ̀tì','Choose a widget'=>'Yan wiṣeti kan','Widget area'=>'Agbegbe Wigi','Choose a widget area'=>'Yan agbegbe fídíìítì kan','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Àwòrán yìí kò ní ìbú tàbí gíga, nítorí náà ojú ìwé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Yan án láti inú Àkójọ Àwòrán, tàbí kí o ṣètò ìbú àti gíga rẹ̀.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Fidio yìí kò wá láti Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán, nítorí náà a kò mọ ìwọ̀n rẹ̀, ojú ewé náà yóò sì fó lọ sókè nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Ṣe àgbéṣọ rẹ̀ sí Ilé Ìkópamọ́ Àwòrán dípò bẹ́ẹ̀.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Àwòrán, fídíò tàbí fífírù kankan nínú HTML yìí kò ní ìbú àti gíga, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà yóò fò nígbà tí ó bá ń kó. Fi àwọn àbùdá ìbú àti gíga kún un.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Èké yìí ń tún iwọn ara rẹ̀ ṣe lẹ́yìn tí ó bá gbé wọlé, èyí tí ó ń gbe àwọn ohun inú tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ rẹ̀ kúrò ní ipò. Fún ní àyè tàbí gbé e sí ìsàlẹ̀ diẹ lórí ojú ewé náà.','Layout shift'=>'Yiyipada Iṣeto','Desktop'=>'Kọmputa ti tabili','Default'=>'Àiyàsọ','Every track'=>'Gbogbo orin','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Àwọn ìwọ̀n ọ̀nà, fún àpẹẹrẹ: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Awọn iwọn orin aṣa','Equal tracks'=>'Àwọn ojú ọ̀nà tí ó dọ́gba','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Àwọn ìlà tí a fọ̀rọ̀ mọ́lẹ̀ kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ: "head head" "side main". Fún agbègbè náà ní orúkọ lórí ẹ̀yà àtẹ̀lé kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Automatic'=>'Láìsí àtúnṣe','Square (1:1)'=>'Onigun Mẹrin (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Ọ̀wọ̀n 