i, ṣugbọn kii ṣe nigbati ẹrọ wọn ba beere fun iṣipopada ti o dinku. Titi di igba yẹn, wọn ri aworan panini naa.','Replace poster image'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àwòrán àfihàn','Choose poster image'=>'Yan àworò ìfihàn','Background slideshow'=>'Fọ́tò abẹ́lẹ́ tó ń yí padà','Change images'=>'Yipada awọn aworan','Choose images'=>'Yan àwọn àwòrán','Choose at least two images.'=>'Yan o kere ju aworan meji lo.','Seconds per image'=>'Àwọn àáyá fún àwòrán kọ̀ọ̀kan','Fade'=>'Fi ojiji bo','Slide'=>'Yọ̀','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Sísùn lọ́dọ̀raun (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Yọ slideshow kuro','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Àwọn àlejò tí wọ́n bá béèrè fún ìgbésẹ̀ díẹ̀ lórí ẹ̀rọ wọn yóò rí àwòrán àkọ́kọ́ nìkan.','Section effects'=>'Awọn ipa apakan','Top divider'=>'Apakan oke','Bottom divider'=>'Apá ìsàlẹ̀','Choose the logo'=>'Yan aami-idanimọ náà','Not set'=>'Ko ti ni aago','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ àwọn àwọ̀ àmì-ìdánimọ̀ náà: olúkúlùkù nílò orúkọ àrà ọ̀tọ̀ àti àwọ̀ tó tọ̀nà.','Brand name'=>'Orukọ àmì ọjà','Replace logo'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ àwòrán logo','Choose logo'=>'Yan àmì-ìdánimọ̀','A logo is chosen.'=>'A yan aami-idanimọ kan.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Yan aami-idanimọ lati oju-iwe apẹrẹ aaye.','Remove logo'=>'Yọ aami','Brand colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ àmì ọjà','Remove %s'=>'Yọ %s','Brand %d'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀yà %d','Add brand colour'=>'Fi àwọ̀ ami si','Heading font'=>'Fọọmu àkọlé','Body font'=>'Fọọntì ara','Tone of voice'=>'Ohùn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Bii ami-iṣowo rẹ ṣe kọ, f.apẹrẹ “Ore-ọfẹ ati rọrun, awọn gbolohun kukuru, ko si ẹ̀dá-ọ̀rọ̀ asan.” AI n tẹle e nígbàkugbà ti o ba kọ fun aaye yii.','Brand kit saved.'=>'A fipamọ ohun elo ami iyasọtọ naa.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'A ti lo aami naa: awọn awọ, awọn fọọti ati aami rẹ jẹ ti aaye naa bayi.','Apply to site'=>'Fi sori aaye','All classes'=>'Gbogbo kilasi','Class name on the page'=>'Orukokilasi lori ojú-ewe rẹ','Printed as %s.'=>'A tẹ̀ sí %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Bẹrẹ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan; àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, àwọn nọ́mbà àti àwọn àmì ìfàmọ̀ nìkan.','Styles'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà irísí','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Awọn ìṣàkóso àṣà kò kún. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà; tí èyí bá ń bá a lọ, tún fi sọ́tùn-ún plugin náà.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'A ti fi kilasi naa pamọ. Gbogbo nkan ti o nlo o ni aṣa tuntun naa.','Save class'=>'Fipamọ kilasi','Class created.'=>'A ti dá kilásì náà sílẹ̀.','New class'=>'Kilásì tuntun','e.g. Card'=>'fagan Kààtì','Create'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá','Search classes'=>'Wá awọn kilasi','No class matches.'=>'Kò sí kilàsí tó báamu.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Kò sí àwọn kílàsì kankan ṣì. Ṣẹda ọ̀kan, ṣe àṣà rẹ̀, lẹ́yìn náà fi kún èyíkéyìí ẹ̀yà láti inú àwọn ètò rẹ̀.','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','Duplicate %s'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá %s mìíràn','Class duplicated.'=>'A ṣe ẹ̀dà kíláìsì náà.','Delete %s'=>'Pa %s rẹ́','Class deleted.'=>'A ti pa kilasi naa rẹ́.','Delete'=>'Paarun','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ pa kíláàsì "%s" rẹ́? Àwọn ohunèlò tó ń lò ó yóò mú àkóónú wọn dúró ṣùgbọ́n wọn yóò sọ àwọn àṣà rẹ̀ nù.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Àwọn olùmúlò tí wọ́n le fi HTML tí kò ní àlẹmọ kún nìkan ló lè yí CSS àṣà padà.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Apakan ninu CSS yii ni a kii yoo lo: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" ati awọn àmì ìdúró ti ko ni ibamu ni a yọ kuro fun aabo.','Upload a font'=>'Gbe fọọntii soke','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Igbékálsẹ̀ àwọn fóǹtì nílò WordPress 6.5 tàbí jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ.','Font name'=>'Oruko fọọmu','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'fami. o. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s ti wọle ati pe o ṣetan lati lo.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Yan faili fọọntu (lailai %s)','Font library'=>'Ilé-kíkọ fòntì','%d files'=>'%d àwọn fáìlì','Font switched off for the site.'=>'A ti pa fọndì kúrò fún ojula náà.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'A ti tan fọnti sori aaye naa.','Switch off'=>'Pa kuro','Switch on'=>'Tan si','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Fi ìdámọ̀ ohun elo wẹ́bù Adobe Fonts rẹ̀ sílẹ̀. A óò bá a gbe àwọn lẹ́tà wọ̀nyí wọlé láti Adobe sórí àwọn ojú ìwé rẹ̀.','Your web projects'=>'Awọn iṣẹ wẹẹbu rẹ','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'A ti sopọ Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'A ti ge Adobe Fonts kuro.','Kit id'=>'Àmì ẹ̀mọ́ ohun èlò','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Iye òkùnkùn fún "%s" kì í ṣe àwọ̀ tó tọ́.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Nígbà tí àlejò kan kò bá ti yan','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Tẹ̀ lé ẹ̀rọ alejo náà','Dark colours'=>'Awọn àwọ̀ dúdú','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Fun awọ kọọkan ni ẹya dudu rẹ. Awọn awọ ti o fi silẹ ni ṣofo yoo wa ni kanna ni awọn eto mejeeji. Ẹya dudu wa lori ni kete ti awọ kan ba ni iye dudu kan.','Dark version of %s'=>'Ẹ̀dà dúdú ti %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ ipo òkùnkùn.','Page CSS'=>'CSS Ojú-ewé','Global classes'=>'Àwọn kílàsì gbogbo gbòò','Classes'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀ka','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn kilasi ni Apẹrẹ aaye (Site design), lẹhinna fi them kun nibi.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Ti A Ṣe Àṣàyàn Rẹ̀','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Kọ awọn ofin fun eroja yii. "selector" tumọ si eroja yii, fun apẹẹrẹ selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — awọn alaye ti o rọrun kan si eroja funrararẹ.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Awọn faili fọọti gbọdọ jẹ %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Fáìlì fọ́ọ̀tù yẹn jẹ́ òfo tàbí ó tóbi ju 10 MB lọ.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Ṣe àṣà lẹ́ẹ̀kan, tún lò ó ní ibi gbogbo, yí padà ní ibi kan.','Variables'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a lè yí padà','Named values any element can use.'=>'Awọn iye tí a sọ fúnni tí ohunèlò èyíkéyìí lè lò.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Ààyè, ìwọ̀n àti àwọn ojiji','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Àwọn iwọ̀n tí olùyànàyè ààyè kọ̀ọ̀kan, igun àti ojiji fúnni.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Ẹya dídúùkú àwọn àwọ̀ rẹ, fún àwọn alábẹ̀wò tí wọ́n fẹ́ ẹ.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Àmì ilé-iṣẹ́, àwọn àwọ̀, àwọn ìrí lẹ́tà àti irú ohùn, tí AI àti àwọn àdàkọ ń lò.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Gbe awọn fọọti tirẹ soke tabi sopọ Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS fun ojú-ewé yii nikan.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS fún ojú-ewé yìí','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Wọ́n kó o sí ojúewé yìí nìkan, lẹ́yìn àwọn àṣà ojúewé náà. Wọ́n fi pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ojúewé náà.','Short name'=>'Oríkì kúkurú','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Awon oruko kukuru "%s" ti lo ni eemeji.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": àwọn orúkọ kúkúrú ń lò àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, nọ́mbà àti àmì ìyàsọtọ̀.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Iye "%s" kii ṣe eyiti eto yii gba.','Radius'=>'Rediosi','Add a step'=>'Fi igbese kun','Scales saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn iwọn naa.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'A ti da awọn iwọn pada si awọn aiyipada.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Túnṣe sí ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀ntún àìyípadà','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Kò sí àwọn iyipada kankan síbẹ̀. Iyipada kan máa ń mú iye kan — ìfẹ̀, àpapọ̀ àwọ̀, ìwọ̀n fọ́ọ̀tì — tí ọ̀pọ̀ àwọn ohunèlò pín.','Add variable'=>'Fi ayipada kun','Variables saved.'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a fipamọ́.','No colours yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí àwọn àwọ̀ kankan.','Colour %d'=>'Àwọ̀ %d','Add colour'=>'Fi awọ kun','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Àwùjọ àwọ̀ méjì náà ní orúkọ kan náà. Tún sọ̀rọ̀ fún ọ̀kan lára wọn orúkọ mìíràn.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" kò ṣeé ṣe láti lò gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọ̀ tó tọ́.','Theme colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ ojú-iṣẹ́','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Àwọ̀ ojú-ìwé rẹ̀. Iyipada kan níhìn-ín ni a má a ń pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹ̀yà àwọ̀ ojú-wẹ̀bù rẹ̀, gẹ́gẹ́ gangan bí Ọ̀gáǹgàn Olootu Ojú-ìwé (Site Editor) ṣe ń pa á mọ́, ó sì wúlò ní gbogbo ibi tí a ti ń lò àwọ̀ náà.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Awọn àwọ̀ ojú-ìwé ti padà sí àwọn iye ti ojú-ìwé fúnra rẹ̀.','Reset theme colours'=>'Tún àwọn àwọ̀ ojú-ìwé ṣe','Your colours'=>'Àwọn àwọ̀ rẹ','Colours saved.'=>'Awọn àwọ̀ ti fi pamọ́.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Yan àwọ̀ kan fún %s','Clear'=>'Ko kuro','The change could not be saved.'=>'A ko le fi iyipada naa pamọ.','Close panel'=>'Pa pátákì náà','Theme default'=>'Àkọ́ṣẹ́ńsì kókó','Theme fonts'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀tù àkòrí','Your fonts'=>'Àwọn fọ́ǹtì rẹ','Font stack'=>'Àkójọ lẹ́tà fọ́ntì','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Fọnt tí a gbejade: àwọn fáìlì rẹ̀ wá láti ilé-ìkàwọ̀ fọnt.','System sans-serif'=>'Sistemù sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Fi akójọ fọ́ọ̀tù kún un','Fonts saved.'=>'Àwọn fífọ̀n pamọ́.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Tí a pín pẹ̀lú àkòrí rẹ àti Olootu Aaye.','Fonts'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀tù','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Àwọn fọ́ǹtì àkọlé àti ara fún gbogbo ojú òpó wẹ́bù náà.','Back to Site design'=>'Padà sí Apẹẹrẹ ojula','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Awọn kilasi, àmì, ipò òkùnkùn, ohun elo aami ati awọn fọọmu aṣa wa pẹlu Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Ṣí àwọn àṣà Ṣátì Ẹ̀dítọ̀ (Site Editor)','Heading'=>'Orí-ọ̀rọ̀','Plain'=>'Wọn','Accent'=>'Ìfihàn èdè','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ko si awọn ede ti o le yipada laarin wọn. Oluyipada naa yoo han nigbati afikun itumọ ba ṣe at তালিকা ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ.','Switcher'=>'Olùyípadà','Show the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ hàn','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Fi Tranzly sori ki o si ṣe atọju awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ, yoo si han nibi.','List'=>'Atọka','Pills'=>'Àwọnéǹtìkéré','Buttons'=>'Awọn bọtini','Dropdown'=>'Àlejò ìtẹ̀sílé','Language codes'=>'Àwọn kóòdù èdè','Show each language as'=>'Fi èdè kọọkan han gẹgẹ bi','Language name'=>'Orúkọ èdè','Language code'=>'Koodu ede','Name and code'=>'Oruko ati koodu','Flags'=>'Àwọn àmì','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Pa kuro ni aiyipada: asia jẹ orilẹ-ede kan, kii ṣe ede kan.','Include the current language'=>'Fi ede lọwọlọwọ kun un','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Fi awọn ede ti a ko tumọ oju-iwe yii si pamọ','Stack vertically'=>'Ko sori si isale','Background'=>'Ẹ̀yìn-ilé','Current language text'=>'Èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Current language background'=>'Àyíká èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Size and spacing'=>'Iwọn ati aaye','Space between languages'=>'Ààyè láàárín àwọn èdè','Text size'=>'Iwọn ọrọ','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s náà tún ń ṣe àtúnṣe ojú ewé yìí. Ìpamọ́ lè sọ àwọn àtúnṣe wọn di asán.','Block library'=>'Ilé kíkọ àwọn ohun tí a dènà','Layers'=>'Àwọn ìpele','Page canvas'=>'Ojú ìwé fọ́nrán','Revisions'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe','Block settings'=>'Àwọn ètò ìdènà','Add block: %s'=>'Fi bulọọki kun: %s','(no title)'=>'(kò sí àkọlé)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ṣí nínú Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Fagile mo','Redo'=>'Tun se','Show or hide layers'=>'Fi han tabi tọ́ fẹlẹfẹlẹ','Show or hide the block library'=>'Fi hàn tàbí pa ile ikawe bulọọki mọ','Show revisions'=>'Fi awọn atunyẹwo han','Open the normal editor'=>'Ṣii olùṣatunṣo déédéé','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Àwọn ọ̀nà àbájọ bọ́tìnnì tẹlifóònù','Preview: desktop'=>'Ayẹwo: kọmputa tabili','Preview: tablet'=>'Àwòrán Àkọ́kọ́: tábìlì','Preview: mobile'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ: mobile','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Ṣe àwọn àṣà àti ìrísí ohun tí o ti yàn lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Lẹ́ mọ́ sórí blọ́kì tí a yàn','Copy the selected section'=>'Da apakan ti a yan n’ṣe','Paste a copied section'=>'Lẹ̀ mọ́ apá kan tí a dá se ẹ̀dọ̀kọ̀wé','Turn off safe mode'=>'Pa ipo ailewu rẹ kuro','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Tan ipo aabo (awọn afikun miiran pa, fun ọ, ni Studio nikan)','Published'=>'Ti tẹjade','Scheduled'=>'A ti ṣètò rẹ̀','Pending review'=>'Wọ́n ń ṣe àyẹ̀wò rẹ̀','Private'=>'Ikọọkan','Draft'=>'Àkọpamọ́','All changes saved'=>'Gbogbo ayipada ti wa ni ipamọ','Saving…'=>'Ìpamọ́ lọ́wọ́…','Autosaving…'=>'Ìfipamọ́ fúnra rẹ̀…','Unsaved changes'=>'Àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́','autosaved'=>'ti a fipamọ laifọwọyi','Desktop preview'=>'Ayẹwo oju opo wẹẹmu lori kọmputa tabili','Tablet preview'=>'Àwòrán àkọkọ ti tábìlì','Mobile preview'=>'Ààyè àwòrán fún fóònù alágbèékùn','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'%1$s ifihan tẹlẹ (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Ọpa irinṣẹ Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Pad bẹ sí olùṣàtúnṣe déédéé','Page title'=>'Akọlé ojú-ewé','Preview width'=>'Iwọn awotẹlẹ','Command palette'=>'Paleti àṣẹ','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Wo ojú-ewé náà (ó ṣí ní tàbù tuntun kan)','Save draft'=>'Fipamọ iwe afọwọkọ','Publish'=>'Tẹjade','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ́ mú àwọn àyípadà tí kò tíì fipamọ́ padà bọ̀ sípò?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Ojú-ewé yìí ní àwọn àtúnṣe tí kò tíì fipamọ́ rí. A tọ́jú wọn sínú aṣàwákiri yìí:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Ojúewé yìí ní ìpamọ́ àràǹgbá tó tuntun ju ẹ̀yà tó ti dáná sílẹ̀ lọ:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mu awọn ayipada ti a ko fipamọ bọ sipọ','Discard'=>'Pa tì','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe kò lè kó àwọn wọlé.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Àtúnṣe ti padà bọ̀ sípò. Ṣe ìpamọ́ láti tọ́jú rẹ̀, tàbí kí o fagile láti padà sẹ́yìn.','Close revisions'=>'Pa awọn atunyẹwo kuro','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ko si àtúnyẹwò kankan síbẹ̀. Ìpamọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan máa ń ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan.','Revision from %s'=>'Àtúnyẹ̀wẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ %s','Restore this revision'=>'Muu àtúnṣe yìí bọ̀ sípò','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'A kò lè yí ipò àìléwu padà.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Ipo ailewu wa ni titan.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d àfikọ̀ tòótọ́ míràn ti pa, fún ọ àti ní Sandwich Studio nìkan. Ojú-wẹ́bù wíwà alààyè àti àwọn olùṣe mìíràn kò ní ipa kankan.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Modo ailewu: pa àwọn àfikún yòókù ní Studio, fún ìwọ nìkan','Save your changes.'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada rẹ.','Undo your last change.'=>'Pa iyipada rẹ ti o kẹhin kuro.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Tun ṣe iṣẹ afipamọ rẹ to kẹhin.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Fi hàn tàbí fi pa pálẹ̀ kíkún sẹ́hìn.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Fi awọn ọna abuja kiibọọju wọnyi han.','Select a block first.'=>'Yan bulọọki kan ni akọkọ.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Aṣọ tii daakọ. Lẹẹmọ sori eyikeyi bulọọki, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Ẹ̀rọ àwárí kò jẹ́ kó ṣe ẹ̀dà.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'A ti da apakan naa. Ṣe lẹẹmọ rẹ sinu eyikeyi oju-iwe, lori aaye yii tabi omiran.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ko si àṣà tí a dá kọ̀ sí orí clipboard láti Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Àwoṣe ti a lẹ̀ mọ́ori bọ́ọ̀lu %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Ara yẹn kò bá bọ́ síi pẹ̀lú bọ́ọ̀kì tí a yan.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Pátì kọ́ọ̀bù náà kò ní apá kan tí a dá.','Section pasted.'=>'A ti lẹ apakan na.','Paste style'=>'Fi aṣa pamọ','Paste section'=>'Ṣẹ́gun abala','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Tẹ Ctrl+V (tabi Cmd+V lori Mac) nibi lati lẹ mọ́ ọn','Copy style'=>'Da aṣa kọọkan','Copy section'=>'Ṣàkọ́ ìpín náà','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe nínú Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Ìpamọ́ kùnà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìsopọ̀ rẹ kí o sì tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; a ti pa àwọn àtúnṣe rẹ mọ́ sínú aṣàwákiri yìí.','Published.'=>'Ti a tẹjade.','Saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Ipo ìtọjú ati ìpèsè ṣáájú ìfilọlẹ','What visitors see'=>'Ohun ti awọn alejo n rii','The site, as normal'=>'Ojula, gẹgẹ bii ti iṣe','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Itọju: akiyesi kan, ati pe a sọ fun awọn ẹrọ wiwa lati padanu nigbamii','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Ìgbà akọkọ iṣẹ́: àkíyèsí kan, a sì sọ fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí pé kí wọ́n má ṣe ṣe Àkọọ́lẹ̀ ojú-wọ̀n náà','Page to show instead'=>'Ojú-ewé tí a ó fi hàn dípò rẹ̀','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Ṣe apẹrẹ eyikeyi oju-iwe pẹlu oluṣe ki o yan aṣayan yẹn nibi. Laisi rẹ, awọn alejo yoo ri akiyesi kukku pẹlu orukọ aaye naa.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Tani o tun n rii aaye gidi (awọn olutọju nigbagbogbo n rii):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Ṣí ojú-wẹ́bù náà nínú fèrèsí ìpamọ́ láti rí ohun tí àwọn alábàábẹ̀wò rí.','Network settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto nẹtiwọọki naa.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí kàn sí ojú-wọ́òbù %d nínú nẹ́twọ̀kì yìí.','Shared templates'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí a pín lò','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Àwọnà tí a fi pamọ́ sórí ojú-òpó wẹ́bù àkọ́kọ́ tí a fàmì sí níbí máa ń hàn sórí gbogbo ojú-òpó wẹ́bù, lábẹ́ “Network templates”. Ojú-òpó wẹ́bù kọ̀ọ̀kan fi ẹ̀dà tirẹ̀ síbẹ̀.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Ko si àpẹẹrẹ kankan ti a fipamọ sori ojula akọkọ sibẹsibẹ.','White label for every site'=>'Àwìṣẹ fún ojú òpó wẹ́bù kọ̀ọ̀kan','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Lilo nipasẹ gbogbo aaye ti ko ti fipamọ awọn eto white-label tirẹ.','Turn white label on'=>'Tan aami funfun si tan','Builder name'=>'Oruko olùkọ́','Visual editor name'=>'Orúkọ olóòtú ojú-iṣẹ́ awòrán','Author'=>'Olùkọ̀wé','Author website'=>'Oju opo webu onkowe','Menu icon'=>'Àwòrán àkójọ aṣàyàn','Role defaults for every site'=>'Àwọn ohun àìyípadà ipò fún gbogbo ojú òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù','Save network settings'=>'Fipamọ awọn eto nẹtiwọki','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Wiwa… A ti ṣayẹwo nkan %d di isisiyi.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó báramù nínú àwọn nǹkan %d. Kò sí ohun láti rọ́pò.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'%1$d baramu lori oju-iwe %2$d (awọn ohun %3$d ti a wa). Ko si ohun ti o ti yipada sibẹsibẹ.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Ní rirọ́pọ̀… %1$d nínú %2$d ojú ewé ti parí.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'Ti ṣe: %d ojú-ewé ti yípadà. O le yí eyi pada.','Undoing…'=>'Ní báyìí ló ń yí padà…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'A ti fagile: Oju-iwe %1$d ni a tunṣe. Oju-iwe %2$d ni aṣatọ ti a ṣe lẹhin rirọpo naa a si fi silẹ bi wọn ṣe wa.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'A ti ṣe é: Oju-iwe %d ti tunṣe.','Replace'=>'Rọ́pọ̀','Links'=>'Àwọn Ìjápọ̀','Find'=>'Wa','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Àwọ̀ hex kan bí #1a73e8. Àwọn ẹ̀dà kúkúrú (#fff) náà bá mu.','Replace with'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ pẹ̀lú','Match upper and lower case'=>'Bar lẹta 𱃡tọ ati kekere','Search in'=>'Wá ninu','Find matches'=>'Wa awọn ibamu','Page'=>'Ojú-ewé','Matches'=>'Awọn ti o baamu','Replace on %d page'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ lórí ojú ewé %d','Undo this replacement'=>'Fagile rirọpo yii','Review comments'=>'Ṣe àyẹ̀wò àwọn àlàyé','Add a comment'=>'Fi àlàyé kun un','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Àsọyé %1$d láti ọwọ́ %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Awọn asọye %d lori oju-iwe yii.','Your name'=>'Oruko re','Your comment'=>'Àlàyé rẹ','Send comment'=>'Fi asọye ranṣẹ','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Ẹ ku iṣẹ, a ti fi asọye rẹ ranṣẹ.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Tẹ apakan ojú-ewé tí asọye rẹ da lori.','Client review'=>'Àyẹ̀wọ̀ alabára','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'A ko le ri apakan oju-iwe yẹn: o le ti yipada tabi yọ kuro lati igba ti a ti sọ asọye naa.','Review link'=>'Ayẹwo àjápọ̀','Let a client comment on this page'=>'Jẹ́ kí oníbàárà sọ̀rọ̀ lórí ojú ewé yìí','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'Ẹnikẹni tí ó bá ní ọna aṣojútó yẹn le ri ojúewé yìí, kódà kí a tó gbe e jáde, kí wọn sì sọ àlàyé sílẹ̀. Kò nílò àkọọ́lẹ̀ kankan.','Copied'=>'Wọn ti daakọ rẹ̀','Copy link'=>'Èakọ ọna aṣopọ','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'Se ìsopọ̀ tuntun kan (èyí tí ó ti pẹ́ yóò dẹ́kun ṣiṣẹ́)','Comments (%d open)'=>'Àwọn àlàyé (%d sílẹ̀)','Show resolved comments'=>'Ṣe àfihàn àwọn àlàyé tí a ti yanju','No comments to show.'=>'Ko si awọn asọye lati fihan.','Reply'=>'Dáhùn','Send reply'=>'Firanṣẹ esi','Show in the editor'=>'Fi hàn ninu olùṣàtúnṣọ̀','Resolve'=>'Yanjú','Reopen'=>'Tún Ṣí','Open Sandwich Studio'=>'Iṣẹ́ Aṣàbójútó Sandwich Yí','Change styles'=>'Yipada awọn àwòṣe','Custom CSS and HTML'=>'CSS àti HTML tó jẹ́ àṣàyàn rẹ','Manage templates'=>'Ṣakoso awọn àdàkọ','Use AI'=>'Lo AI','Client mode: text and images only'=>'Ipo onibara: ọrọ ati awọn aworan nikan','Role settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto ipa naa.','Roles and client mode'=>'Awọn ipa ati ipo alabara','Choose what each role can do in the builder. Administrators can always do everything. Client mode locks the layout and design, so the role can only change text and images.'=>'Yan ohun ti ipa kọọkan le ṣe ninu oluṣe. Awọn oluleṣe nigbagbogbo le ṣe ohun gbogbo. Ipo alabara ni titii ipilẹ ati apẹrẹ, nitorinaa ipa naa le yipada ọrọ ati awọn aworan nikan.','Role'=>'Ipò','Save role settings'=>'Fi awọn eto ipa sori ẹrọ pamọ','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'A ti fipamọ. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé náà láti rí àwọn orúkọ tuntun náà.','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'Tún orúkọ olùkọ́lé náà sọ àti kí o pa àmì ìdánimọ̀ wa mọ́ lórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'A fi hàn ní gbogbo ibi tí orúkọ ọjà náà ti hàn: àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn, olóòtú, àti àwọn àkíyèsí.','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'Fi iṣofo lati lo orukọ olukọni naa.','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'Àpèjúwe lórí ojú ìwé àwọn Ìgbékalẹ̀ (Plugins)','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Orukọ Dashicons kan (fún àpẹrẹ dashicons-admin-customizer) tàbí àdírẹsì àwòrán https:// kan.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Fi pọọluín náà pamọ́ kuro lori iboju Pọọluín (Plugins)','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Awọn olumulo ajọṣepọ ti o tun rii ọja gidi ati awọn eto wọnyi','%d new'=>'%d titun','%d replaced'=>'A ti rọ́pọ̀ %d','%d kept as they were'=>'%d ni a tọju bi wọn ti wa tẹlẹ','%d setting'=>'ètò %d','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Gbigbe wọle yoo funni ni: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'A gbe wọle: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'A ti gbe nkan %d jade.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Ko le ka fáìlì yẹn gẹ́gẹ́ bí fáìlì ìṣáfihàn.','Export'=>'Gbe jade','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Gbà àwọn àdàkọ rẹ, àwọn àpẹẹrẹ ati ìṣètò ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù gẹ́gúù fáìlì kan, láti gbé wọlé sórí ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù mìíràn.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Ko si awọn awoṣe tabi awọn ilana lati gbe jade yet.','Include the settings'=>'Fi àwọn ètò náà kún un','Download the export file'=>'Ṣe agbekale faili wẹẹbọ wọle','Import'=>'Wọlé','Choose an export file'=>'Yan faili ifawọjade kan','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Fáìlì náà ní ohun kan %1$d láti ọdọ %2$s.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Nígbà tí ohun kan tí ó ní orúkọ kan náà bá ti wà níhìn-ín tẹ́lẹ̀','Keep the one on this site'=>'Fi eyiti o wa lori aaye yii si silẹ','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú èyí tí a gbé wọlé','Import a copy beside it'=>'Gbe ẹ̀dà kan wọlé lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ rẹ̀','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Lo awọn eto ti o wa ninu faili naa','Copy the images into this site’s media library'=>'Da awọn aworan naa kọ sinu ile-ikawe media aaye yii','Show what will happen'=>'Fi ohun tí yóò ṣẹlẹ hàn','block titleAlert'=>'Ìkìlọ̀','block descriptionA notice for your visitors: information, success, a warning or an error, with an optional title and a close button.'=>'Àkíyèsí kan fún àwọn alábèwò rẹ: ìsọfìtì, àṣeyọrí, ì kìlọ̀ tàbí àṣìṣe kan, pẹ̀lú àkọlé àti bọ́tìnnì ìṣúnà tí a lè lò tàbí kó má ṣe lò.','block keywordnotice'=>'àkíyèsí','block keywordmessage'=>'ifiranṣẹ','block keywordcallout'=>'ìpe ìkìlọ̀','block keywordwarning'=>'Ìkìlọ̀','block titleButton link'=>'Ọna asopọ bọtini','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Ọna aṣopọ kan tí a ṣe bí bọtìnì.','block keywordbutton'=>'bọtìnì','block keywordlink'=>'ọna asopọ','block keywordcall to action'=>'pè láti ṣe ohun kan','block titleColumn'=>'Kọlọmọ','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'KỌLÙMÙ kan laarin rọ́wọ́ kan. O le gbe eyikeyi bulọọki mu.','block keywordcolumn'=>'kọlọmù','block keywordlayout'=>'èdè ojú-iṣẹ́','block titleContainer'=>'Abà nkan-ìpamọ́','block descriptionA box that lays out the blocks inside it with flexbox or a grid. Nest containers to build any layout. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Apoti kan ti o n gbe awọn bulọọki si inu rẹ pẹlu flexbox tabi akoj kan. Awọn apoti itẹ-ẹgbẹ lati kọ eyikeyi apẹrẹ. O wa ni kika ti a ba pa afikun naa.','block keywordcontainer'=>'apá kan','block keywordbox'=>'àpótí','block keywordgrid'=>'giridi','block keywordflexbox'=>'flexbox','block keywordcolumns'=>'àwọn Òpó','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Ayipada ede (àpeẹrẹ)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn èdè ojú-wọlé láti inú plọ́gìnnì ìtumọ̀, nígbà tí ẹnì kan bá ń ṣiṣẹ́. Kò ní fi ohunkohun hàn bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'olùyípadà','block titleSample content'=>'Àkọsẹ̀ṣe àpẹẹrẹ','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Oríkì kan àti ìpínrọ̀ kan, tí a fi àwọn orúkọ kíláàsì tí kò ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ hàn. Ó jẹ́ bálọ́ọ̀kù ìtọ́kasí fún àdéhùn ìtumọ̀ náà.','block keywordsample'=>'àpẹẹrẹ','block keywordtext'=>'ọ̀rọ̀','block titleIcon'=>'Àwòrán kékeré','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Àwòrán SVG kan. A ti sọ àmì náà di mímọ́ kí a tó fi hàn.','block keywordicon'=>'àmì-ìdánimọ̀','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Atọka ede','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin 